  "sn46.175-184:2.1": "ogho yogo upādānaṃ ",
  "sn46.175-184:2.2": "gantho anusayena ca, ",
  "sn46.175-184:2.3": "kāmaguṇā nīvaraṇā ",
  "sn46.175-184:2.4": "khandhā oruddhambhāgiyāti. ",
